{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "076335a68455de7dc47fde20e7a13539a0d1bf1de6ef0c82b83cecd9d149e57b", "ja": "いい子のうらがわ", "zh": "乖孩子的另一面", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3c7ad76a00ede647844ccc91cc34e07f7391e189553f51d10eb01ad1199d0604", "ja": "ある日、ロッカーで伊織の忘れ物を見つけた\n育は、プロデューサーと水瀬家へと向かう。\n伊織の難しい家庭事情を知り、モヤモヤして\nしまった育。帰り道にて、プロデューサーは\nさりげなくアドバイスをするのだった。", "zh": "有一天，育在储物柜里发现了伊织遗忘的东西。  \n她和制作人一起前往水濑家。  \n得知伊织复杂的家庭情况后，育心里一直有些郁闷。  \n回去的路上，制作人若无其事地给出了建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b0ed136edbac35321425e3e450dd611af6a6c46bed1b1719db94a4ca8f62e8ec", "ja": "（アイドル達は『いい子ポイント』をそれぞれに\n獲得し始めている。順調でなによりだ）", "zh": "（偶像们已经开始各自获得“好孩子积分”了。进展顺利就好。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "241d4b07089cd241cab0fdb5374f1bf1bfdb8a4dda5d88696b366b03886fd3ed", "ja": "（おかげで、動画の方も溜まり始めて……。\n編集の方も頑張って進行しないとな……！）", "zh": "（多亏了这样，视频也开始积攒起来了……编辑工作也得努力推进才行啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "b0d096d984938a84a779d76b9e0440fa45794baec61df1d5b385cf39a7975d81", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n今ちょっといい？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n现在方便说两句吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b1f8ce077c7730e824de16b2f617847e9e47753bec510dcf5687bf5c6336b99d", "ja": "育か。\n大丈夫だよ、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "是育啊。没关系，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "32697f756f87e9e69abe4fc078ac26d5e8e4471f91bd0d0f4d7a5516389b02a3", "ja": "あのね、ロッカーでスマホの忘れ物を\n見つけたんだけど……。", "zh": "那个，我在更衣柜里发现了一部被遗忘的手机……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "51cba1d75a8b2560e4d1a42bece2b7b0cd8b47ae64035b45716988227f10602d", "ja": "おお、報告してくれてありがとう。\nロッカーならアイドルの忘れ物だと思うけど……。", "zh": "哦，谢谢你来报告。\n是在储物柜里找到的，我想应该是偶像落下的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "ee2fb59067b9a05ba44f3479f680ac9083f532845862f9f5e002d563cefda4f3", "ja": "この機種とスマホケース……\nたぶん、伊織さんのだと思うんだ。", "zh": "这个型号和手机壳……\n我觉得应该是伊织姐姐的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "b37ba718214eeb47c69ff82b5ad6b89c9aa2ffadf8943229e5a831d62921d0cd", "ja": "わたし、届けにいこうかと思って。\nスマホがないと、こまるよね？", "zh": "我想把它送过去。\n没有手机的话，会很麻烦吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ac24c86726f25b7f3de0fafa244662a2443ac0e0abb6f4fa9ee5d2d845fcd447", "ja": "そうだな、育の言う通りだ。よし、伊織の家に\n連絡してみて、間違いなさそうなら届けよう。", "zh": "是啊，育说得对。好，先联系一下伊织家，\n要是确认没问题，就送过去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "e4bd7dad935083e2535ec176cbdcf486effe9351aa06a1b6cbb2e8a33768ef4c", "ja": "ありがとう、育。ちょうど鞄の中を\n探していたところだったの。", "zh": "谢谢你，育。我正好\n在包里找这个呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "0ce3c7e2b96fc4e85633b1a71a0e5b98a8ba47cd381641badc4546dae1a51347", "ja": "ううん。\nこれくらい、なんでもないよ！", "zh": "没什么。\n这点小事，根本不算什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "abf760c82ab65469f67b71f487c3faf6f75a09c97c08ba728a08ac2a91376fc1", "ja": "それで、どうしてアンタまでいるの？", "zh": "所以，为什么连你也在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e2ce2f229545ad13aecfab262bfee281886d2f9a82051ba45220905e2e0a31e5", "ja": "一応付き添いで……。\nあと、ポイント判定員として。", "zh": "我算是陪同过来的……\n另外也是积分评判员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "dee83c2a4df934d571dc2a033dcbde175bb0a6f0a3ccdcf7740d48217819b2fe", "ja": "ああ、なるほどね。\n確かにこれは育にポイントをあげるべきだわ。", "zh": "啊，原来如此。\n确实应该给育加分呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "82ee568a6df5a3ba8eecde0bb6f9e12da663b1fc933a6b1eb91ef1e4b9947bd0", "ja": "あれ？　そういうつもりじゃなかったんだけど……\nでも、ありがとう！　えへへ、助かっちゃった♪", "zh": "咦？我不是那个意思啦……\n不过，谢谢你！嘿嘿，帮大忙啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "cd9e279f826be1068cc0598e369b044607859be9edcfdff0c1e3a7d05e4d4687", "ja": "ええ。育はいい子だから、\nもうけっこうポイントが集まってるんじゃない？", "zh": "嗯。育是个好孩子，已经收集到不少积分了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "4fce267c98264d06333aeee20be8e6cb802d36c4e94c17ed77b44396e2db696b", "ja": "うーん。でも、今もらえたのをあわせても、\nみんなには追いついてないかも……。", "zh": "嗯……不过，就算加上刚才拿到的这些，可能还是赶不上大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "c10f90ad6bb1a6fb521a7362b0d21ba70a2e9b5eafb374db7e06a09922f4a716", "ja": "あら、そうなの？\n実を言うと、私もイマイチなのよね……。", "zh": "哎呀，是这样吗？\n说实话，我也觉得不太理想呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "f8193cd09b58b3b5981018b0e1cd4234cdb4e61be292c8261294d86daa940ac9", "ja": "あ、それならおうちのお手伝いをするのはどう？\nわたしは、よくするんだけど。", "zh": "啊，那样的话，帮家里做做家务怎么样？\n我经常帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "9264ae92d2690cff42d5fed40ace665ea2f6e5b0832222e13bbb7f0e5c3d9bb2", "ja": "おうちのお手伝い……。", "zh": "帮家里做家务……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "15bd1e843e34ce41eb142489f64be93e2025d7bc5c803f50b1174221a5c90da2", "ja": "わたしのおとうさん、お仕事が忙しくて\nあんまり家にいないから。", "zh": "我爸爸工作很忙，\n不太常在家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "0bf6eacbe46e7b12e4b7899f39727fb61ad79b0a69dae25f2eba6e55a07a9196", "ja": "わたしじゃ、おとうさんの代わりにはならないけど。\nなるべく、おかあさんのお手伝いはしてるんだ。", "zh": "虽然我比不上爸爸就是了。\n不过我有尽量帮妈妈分担家务哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "f6f47f72cc5a957f2d226bc3c22a3b8c5474668d0283578a565113996f9fbb03", "ja": "そう……えらいわね。\nでも、私にはちょっと難しいかも……。", "zh": "这样啊……真乖。\n不过，对我来说可能有点难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "2969581303ae0e44dae1126b50c98141a9f87de46ac5ae9138664a16a8945302", "ja": "え？　どうして？", "zh": "咦？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "1ae758f4c7585e9ad5c8d3038fbd07794e5cf2c809833dc49789bdb95740ee19", "ja": "うーん……簡単に言うと、\n私とこの家は、ライバル関係だから。", "zh": "嗯……简单来说，\n我和这个家，是竞争对手的关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "3bcd41ded039583bef9289ffb2fd2f77c20aebfe8ca195070a1fcb28c5033417", "ja": "私は私として、水瀬財閥に勝つのが野望なの。\nだから、手伝いっていってもねー。", "zh": "我想凭自己的力量赢过水濑财阀，这就是我的野心。所以，就算说是帮忙嘛——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "9ad6a1986fe3cd0ed12992ddc848986f82ced71b12d49a97d6b22695eeb32e56", "ja": "だいたい、パパや兄さんが協力してくれるとは\n思えないもの。話をしただけで、笑われそうだわ。", "zh": "再说了，我觉得爸爸和哥哥是不可能帮忙的。光是跟他们提起这件事，恐怕就会被嘲笑吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "708d318a05114ffc1926631ca89f68a054dcb68ee5e5bfe3f447ceac62a29fdf", "ja": "お手伝いするのに、笑われちゃうの？\nなんで？", "zh": "帮忙还会被笑话吗？\n为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "a80a41033999db12fc371398c3b4d5cdd4fa544dde4d5ebd1bc831ca3ef2183a", "ja": "私の兄さん達って、すっごく出来がいいの。\nそれに比べると、ね……。", "zh": "我哥哥们都特别优秀。跟他们比起来，我嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1031_007ior", "source_sha256": "f858bf5595df93e2ef4fb27aab3e13af80d321bb2db92d58a92c7ed16a93b5d2", "ja": "何か手伝うなんて言っても、\n「お前に何ができる」……ってところよ、きっと。", "zh": "就算我说要帮什么忙，\n他们肯定也会觉得：“你能做什么？”……大概就是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "355ed1f7efa8922a345ae782174232a361cb65ab88b54eaaf59468861adde3d3", "ja": "私の手伝いなんて、求められてないの。\n……難しいっていうのはそういうこと。", "zh": "根本没人需要我帮忙。……所谓困难，就是这个意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "a04879b4455f2e91cf883cab0daa7ee718a63a7a607a1cb251d33f096c454c3e", "ja": "だから私も、自分の力で\nトップアイドルを目指してるわけだし。", "zh": "所以我也才会凭自己的力量，以顶尖偶像为目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "d2e15574b0e1c85b2a18a369f924f06f8aa6d67847e5399cf87ccdd46f4cf1f7", "ja": "そう、なんだ……。\n……。", "zh": "这样啊……  \n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1035_030iku", "source_sha256": "4416a81b7ab07c2de43e9fa0490e830311e0a5f47d4092909e76b9d92868c7cc", "ja": "あの、伊織さん。\nわたし……。", "zh": "那个，伊织小姐。\n我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1036_007ior", "source_sha256": "d6ce53cbe3ced83e41a4611f43dcaa5d4c3c9ef534ff971bd39ef0b441d63698", "ja": "仲間に嘘は吐きたくないから、\n本当のことを言っただけよ。", "zh": "因为我不想对伙伴撒谎，所以只是说了实话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1037_007ior", "source_sha256": "2db08265979368e9b7e4b7eb227649229aef4195526384c1da1a7fa8f3cd3f45", "ja": "だから育が気にすることじゃないわ。それにこれは、\nあくまで私の家の事情。人には色んな事情があるもの。", "zh": "所以这不是育该在意的事。而且这终究是我家的情况。每个人都有各自的难处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1038_007ior", "source_sha256": "84f3cab35bf40553c5d302418f17c583f06db985bf6a05ffe16ac39f7be8e400", "ja": "育は、おかあさんのお手伝いを\nたくさんしてあげなさい！", "zh": "育，你要多帮妈妈做做事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1039_030iku", "source_sha256": "cd6e106421cec1fb8f18e4393fd5f379904e3e06fee6448e3405ebf757cb6d57", "ja": "う、うん。\n……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "4d000b29206db2b59157c86e30249811e7f4439528c7943c1ec9667fd5a4cb6e", "ja": "育。\nさっきの伊織の話が気になるか？", "zh": "育。你是在意刚才伊织说的那些话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1042_030iku", "source_sha256": "2a96892233455c3eb9b8a53e8b23cfedf4c2fe4d9012b007325f9d8db306fa5c", "ja": "うん……。劇場にはいろんな子がいて、\nいろんな事情があるって、知ってるけど……。", "zh": "嗯……虽然我知道剧场里有各种各样的孩子，\n大家也各有各的情况，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1043_030iku", "source_sha256": "a7a306df692f6eba59617a2ff13005c7219db7f9a25c808aa714f43255e742b3", "ja": "伊織さん……\nさみしく、ないのかな……。", "zh": "伊织姐姐……\n不会感到寂寞吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "07aa7d93b797751050feacb0bf6dce18d23ceb03fb187e2fdf708f20e25a7e27", "ja": "そうだな。育の気持ちもわかるけど……\n難しい問題だから。", "zh": "是啊。我明白育的心情，但是……\n因为这是个很复杂的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1045_030iku", "source_sha256": "a0ff2c8343f4671c620575b9763d0150f4072710f1568531a9265aa3fe1b698b", "ja": "そう、だよね……。わたしに言えることなんて、\nないかもだけど……。", "zh": "是啊，说得也是……我可能也没什么好说的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "a6714b44011703accc3b85e8a9643663475cbe1185b82c1d060ee7dbc2a60193", "ja": "伊織と、伊織の家の事情だからな。\nでも……そうだな。", "zh": "毕竟这是伊织和伊织家里的事啊。不过……也对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "f7cb75852173f612b91aa242279798f8076e014b8ee4f432b4837e398d8a721c", "ja": "育の事情に伊織を巻き込むのは、\nアリなんじゃないか？", "zh": "把伊织卷入育的事情里，或许也不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0431_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0431_story_04_1048_030iku", "source_sha256": "34a0f1ba131608e78a7bb551e39f7d73b4a523399166d3e81452675768d93506", "ja": "わたしの……？", "zh": "我的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
